{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/Strip2.png?t=1746527919\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>A comfortable place to live...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My Heaven's Dale offers a cozy experience within the farm simulator genre, with every detail lovingly designed to keep you free from stress!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops right next to your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use barrels to increase the value of your crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy Chickens, Cows, Pigs, Goats, and Ducks for your Ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete commissions to earn money and gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt 7+ unique Pets to live with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with over 30 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish over 90+ types of fish while picking your next song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore caves with multiple floors and different kinds of gems to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn recipes and complete your Achievement Room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help the town grow with resources and labor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 girls or boys to marry and have a child with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to the Moon, build a house, and meet new creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy new days with different music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join festivals that bring the whole community together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/steampg.jpg?t=174